WEBVTT

00:00:06.830 --> 00:00:08.750
I'm impressed you showed up, Momo Chiyoda!

00:00:08.750 --> 00:00:13.710
<b>Euphrates River</b>

00:00:09.250 --> 00:00:11.420
Today is the day we celebrate
your descent into darkness!

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.710
The festivities are about to begin!

00:00:15.460 --> 00:00:17.210
Da-duuuun...

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:22.540
<b>Tama River</b>

00:00:17.540 --> 00:00:21.540
Momo! Summer vacation is here!
So let's have fun going all out!

00:00:21.670 --> 00:00:22.580
Sure. Sounds good.

00:00:23.540 --> 00:00:24.420
What?

00:00:26.460 --> 00:00:28.330
Da-da-da-duuuun...

00:00:27.170 --> 00:00:29.040
What the heck is up with your outfit?!

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:31.670
I thought I told you to wear something easy to move in!

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:35.960
Well, I don't have any trouble moving in this.
Plus it's breezy. Look, I can do Wing Chun.

00:00:36.710 --> 00:00:39.960
I'm such a pushover that you'd have no trouble
beating me in a flimsy outfit like that, huh?

00:00:40.710 --> 00:00:42.420
Thanks for inviting me.

00:00:42.420 --> 00:00:45.380
What's with the gratitude?! Quit it, you're scaring me!

00:00:45.580 --> 00:00:49.830
Anyways, I've been so pumped up for this
that I even did warm ups to get ready.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.080
<b>Heh</b>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.080
<b>Heh</b>

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:49.080
<b>Heh</b>

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:49.830
Heh, heh, heh.

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.790
Bring it on, Magical Girl!

00:00:50.420 --> 00:00:51.790
<b>POINT</b>

00:00:52.080 --> 00:00:52.710
'Kay.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:56.040
<b>Thought they</b>

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:56.040
<b>were going to</b>

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.040
<b>have a duel.</b>

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.040
<b>Thought they</b>

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.040
<b>were going out</b>

00:00:52.840 --> 00:00:56.040
<b>to have fun.</b>

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:57.710
Hello there.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:00:58.830
Good afternoon.

00:00:59.290 --> 00:01:03.580
Meet the demon girl who recently obtained
her dark powers, Shadow Mistress Yuko,

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:06.460
and the magical girl who once
saved the world, Momo Chiyoda.

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:12.000
<b>DEMON GIRL</b>

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:12.000
<b>SHADOW MISTRESS YUKO</b>

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:12.000
<b>MAGICAL GIRL</b>

00:01:06.040 --> 00:01:12.000
<b>MOMO CHIYODA</b>

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:08.880
As you can see, their fated summer vacation

00:01:08.880 --> 00:01:11.250
of light and darkness is about to begin!

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:47.040
<b>YET ANOTHER SHOWDOWN!</b>

00:02:42.170 --> 00:02:47.040
<b>THE MAGICAL GIRL HAS A BRAND NEW APPEARANCE?!</b>

00:02:47.330 --> 00:02:51.000
Mumble, mumble, mumble...

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:52.380
That morning, I had been completely absorbed
in writing a letter of challenge to Momo.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.380
Heed me, Magical Girl.

00:02:52.380 --> 00:02:54.380
The era of depravity is upon you...

00:02:54.670 --> 00:02:57.630
<b>THE ERA OF DEPRAVITY IS UPON YOU</b>

00:02:55.250 --> 00:02:57.210
I'm too embarrassed to show her my sloppy handwriting.

00:02:57.420 --> 00:02:58.960
I'm gonna have to practice.

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>HRMMM</b>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:02:57.630 --> 00:03:00.210
<b>HRMMM</b>

00:02:59.960 --> 00:03:01.830
Whoa, that looks ominous!

00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:03.460
Wah! Don't scare me, Anri!

00:03:02.080 --> 00:03:03.540
<b>JOLT</b>

00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:05.290
Ummm...

00:03:05.420 --> 00:03:07.920
Shamiko, dear. You've mistaken me for your ink bottle.

00:03:07.920 --> 00:03:09.330
O-oh gosh, I'm sorry!

00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:10.710
Excuse me, Shadow Mistress?

00:03:10.830 --> 00:03:13.000
Are you doing your vacation homework already?

00:03:13.000 --> 00:03:13.710
No.

00:03:13.830 --> 00:03:15.380
This is a letter of challenge.

00:03:15.710 --> 00:03:20.290
There's a Magical Girl in Class A named Momo Chiyoda
who I'm going to challenge to another showdown.

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:23.790
But I can't seem to find the right balance
when writing the kanji for "depravity"...

00:03:20.790 --> 00:03:24.380
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:25.250
The kanji for "Demon" is tough, too.

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:27.420
<b>DEPRAVITY</b>

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:27.420
<b>"DEMON" IS</b>

00:03:24.380 --> 00:03:27.420
<b>TOUGH, TOO</b>

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.420
Perhaps you should give up on writing with a brush.

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:29.000
<b>INK BOTTLE</b>

00:03:28.210 --> 00:03:29.000
Ms. Azaze?

00:03:29.380 --> 00:03:35.080
You know, I actually tried inviting Momo to become
my vassal the other day, but she turned me down.

00:03:35.080 --> 00:03:36.080
"Vassal"?

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:41.630
Allow me to explain. A vassal is someone who you create
a magical familial bond with by signing a contract.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:45.420
It can be a pretty convenient relationship,
depending on the contents of the contract.

00:03:45.830 --> 00:03:47.460
If we can sucker Momo into signing the right contract,

00:03:47.460 --> 00:03:53.420
I'll be able to summon her from far away at whim
and force her to transform into all sorts of strange outfits!

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:57.960
Oh dear, I'm starting to think that Miss Lilith
might not be a very good role model,

00:03:57.960 --> 00:04:00.540
so I'm going to take her away for a little chat, okay?

00:04:00.540 --> 00:04:01.210
Uh oh.

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:03.250
My ancestor just got confiscated.

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:05.330
Please continue, Shadow Mistress.

00:04:05.330 --> 00:04:05.880
Right.

00:04:06.330 --> 00:04:10.710
Momo said that I'm going to have to defeat her first
if I want her to become my vassal.

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:13.580
So I intend to challenge her as much as I can until I win.

00:04:13.580 --> 00:04:17.420
Yes, I certainly agree that Miss Chiyoda
could do with more friends in her life.

00:04:17.420 --> 00:04:20.710
I don't want her as a friend! I want her as my vassal!

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:24.380
Besides, "mistress" typically refers to
a woman of authority

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:29.710
<b>Mistress</b>

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:29.710
<b>1. a woman of power, authority, or ownership</b>

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:29.710
<b>2. a dominatrix</b>

00:04:24.380 --> 00:04:26.500
and considering that you're a self-employed demon,

00:04:26.670 --> 00:04:29.710
it would be more fitting of your name
to recruit staff who work under you.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:32.750
<b>HUMILIATING</b>

00:04:29.880 --> 00:04:32.750
Wait, I didn't know that's what "mistress" meant.
That's kind of humiliating.

00:04:32.920 --> 00:04:35.080
Huh?! You mean you had no idea this whole time?!

00:04:35.330 --> 00:04:38.000
Speaking as your teacher, I'm afraid I can't allow this.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:38.790
Why?!

00:04:38.790 --> 00:04:40.290
My class is finished for the day!

00:04:40.500 --> 00:04:43.630
Clickety-clack! What's Shamiko up to right now?

00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:45.080
Looks like she's writing some kinda letter.

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:47.290
Organizing duels is against the law

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:51.380
And so, I was able to finish writing my letter of challenge
to Momo thanks to Ms. Azaze's help.

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:48.830
and I won't let one of my students start summer vacation

00:04:48.830 --> 00:04:50.830
by going straight into police custody.

00:04:50.830 --> 00:04:52.460
Let's cut back on the threatening tone

00:04:52.460 --> 00:04:53.830
you've got now and make it a more friendly letter.

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:56.290
Your enthusiasm will still come across
as long as you put feelings behind your words, sweetie.

00:04:56.290 --> 00:04:57.040
That makes sense!

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:57.960
I did it!

00:04:57.040 --> 00:04:58.250
<b>To: Momo</b>

00:04:57.960 --> 00:04:58.830
Cute.

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.380
<b>Cute</b>

00:04:58.250 --> 00:04:59.380
<b>To: Momo</b>

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:00.290
<b>Dearest Momo,</b>

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:00.290
<b>how is the heat of</b>

00:04:59.790 --> 00:05:00.290
<b>summer treating you?</b>

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.000
<b>You seemed a bit</b>

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.000
<b>down in the dumps</b>

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.000
<b>a few days ago,</b>

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.000
<b>so I'm showing some</b>

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.000
<b>demonic concern</b>

00:05:00.300 --> 00:05:01.000
<b>for you.</b>

00:05:00.420 --> 00:05:03.130
I have no idea what she's trying to say with all this...

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.000
<b>As of now we're openly cooperating</b>

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.000
<b>with each other to help</b>

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.000
<b>find your sister. However,</b>

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.000
<b>that I have not given up</b>

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.000
<b>on my plan to make you</b>

00:05:01.000 --> 00:05:02.000
<b>my vassal!!</b>

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.000
<b>The era of depravity is upon you!</b>

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.000
<b>Come alone to the riverbank</b>

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.000
<b>at 3 PM this afternoon!</b>

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:03.000
<b>Sincerely yours.</b>

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.000
<b>P.S. It's hot outside.</b>

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.000
<b>Please wear something</b>

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.000
<b>light and easy to move in,</b>

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:04.000
<b>to avoid suffering the heat.</b>

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:05.630
I get it!

00:05:04.630 --> 00:05:06.000
<b>THE MAGICAL GIRL HAD A BREAKTHROUGH!</b>

00:05:06.170 --> 00:05:08.000
What's up? Are you going out, Momo?

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:12.380
Shamiko invited me to hang out with her.
I might not be back until late.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:14.040
And you're going dressed like that?

00:05:14.420 --> 00:05:16.790
She told me to wear something light
and easy to move in.

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.000
But isn't that outfit just a little too uncoordinated?

00:05:19.000 --> 00:05:20.330
I mean, it's a date right?

00:05:20.670 --> 00:05:22.290
I'm pretty sure that it's not a date.

00:05:22.830 --> 00:05:24.040
But I'm gonna get changed.

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.330
Too many "chilling at home" vibes.

00:05:28.540 --> 00:05:29.130
Peep.

00:05:29.130 --> 00:05:30.380
Those make you look style-challenged.

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:36.750
<b>CAT</b>

00:05:31.580 --> 00:05:36.750
<b>JAMBOREE</b>

00:05:32.130 --> 00:05:33.630
Now you're the queen of tacky mountain.

00:05:34.080 --> 00:05:36.250
You know, I'm starting to think
your first outfit was just fine.

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.210
<b>CAT</b>

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:38.210
<b>JAMBOREE</b>

00:05:39.040 --> 00:05:39.750
<b>GRAB</b>

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.380
I'm gonna borrow your clothes!

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.500
<b>CAT</b>

00:05:39.750 --> 00:05:42.500
<b>JAMBOREE</b>

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:41.880
Somebody help! Perv alert!

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.250
<b>TAMA RIVER</b>

00:05:43.080 --> 00:05:44.250
And right now...

00:05:44.750 --> 00:05:47.080
I'm at a total loss on what to do next.

00:05:47.630 --> 00:05:49.540
So, where are we going?

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:50.420
That's hard to say!

00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:52.460
To a better future for demonkind, I guess!

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:53.210
<b>Huh?</b>

00:05:53.670 --> 00:05:55.790
Wait, didn't you make a plan or something?

00:05:55.790 --> 00:05:57.540
I didn't know I needed one!

00:05:57.750 --> 00:06:00.750
I thought things would just play out naturally
once we got started...

00:06:03.330 --> 00:06:05.670
Then I guess we should just go for a stroll.

00:06:06.000 --> 00:06:08.080
There's nothing around here
that'll help us pass the time, anyway.

00:06:08.080 --> 00:06:10.080
We need something to pass the time?

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:11.290
This is more complex than I thought.

00:06:11.500 --> 00:06:12.830
All right, let's go this way.

00:06:12.830 --> 00:06:13.960
Uh, sure!

00:06:20.670 --> 00:06:22.670
This is a park where you can find lots of cats.

00:06:22.670 --> 00:06:23.750
Wow!

00:06:28.000 --> 00:06:30.580
This is a store that has
the Miss Tama Sakura gacha machine!

00:06:30.750 --> 00:06:31.880
Oh, that's cool.

00:06:32.580 --> 00:06:33.960
What's wrong, Momo?!

00:06:34.710 --> 00:06:37.630
