00:06:38.250 --> 00:06:39.250
You can have it, Shamiko.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:41.130
Thank you, I guess...

00:06:41.130 --> 00:06:42.380
What about our duel?!

00:06:42.710 --> 00:06:45.670
<b>Miss Tama Sakura embedded in meat</b>

00:06:43.210 --> 00:06:45.290
D'aww, adorable~!

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.630
<b>TAMA SAKURA</b>

00:06:45.670 --> 00:06:47.630
<b>SHOPPING DISTRICT</b>

00:06:47.960 --> 00:06:49.580
Hmmmph...

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:54.080
Hey, Momo? Did you actually read
my letter of challenge?

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:56.960
Letter of challenge?
You mean the note you gave me at recess?

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:59.710
I read it and thought you were inviting me to hang out.

00:06:59.710 --> 00:07:00.170
Ugh!

00:06:59.830 --> 00:07:00.170
<b>Ugh!</b>

00:07:00.210 --> 00:07:03.540
I wasn't! My goal is to hurry and turn you into my vassal!

00:07:03.540 --> 00:07:05.630
That's why I was calling you out so we could have a fight!

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:10.670
Oh, so... I guess I got the wrong impression.

00:07:11.210 --> 00:07:13.960
You okay? You're looking really depressed
all of a sudden, Momo.

00:07:14.080 --> 00:07:16.130
It's fine, don't worry.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:20.000
I'm just ashamed at myself for being such a...
peachy keen jelly bean.

00:07:21.080 --> 00:07:22.500
What was even the point of this pigtail?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:25.460
Oh crap! Momo's descending into
a different kind of darkness than I intended!

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:29.000
I'm sorry! I just totally ruined
the nice thing that we had going!

00:07:29.000 --> 00:07:32.500
You were trying to make this a good time,
even though I know you struggle with having fun!

00:07:30.830 --> 00:07:31.330
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:07:31.330 --> 00:07:31.830
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:07:31.830 --> 00:07:32.330
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:32.750
<b>I'm sorry!</b>

00:07:32.710 --> 00:07:35.380
Well, I wouldn't put it that way...

00:07:35.960 --> 00:07:38.460
I just don't understand how to have fun in a group.

00:07:38.460 --> 00:07:40.170
Oh yeah? Me, too!

00:07:39.250 --> 00:07:39.710
<b>Okay</b>

00:07:39.790 --> 00:07:40.210
<b>Okay</b>

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:41.460
Okay, let's go back to square one!

00:07:40.330 --> 00:07:40.790
<b>Okay</b>

00:07:40.920 --> 00:07:41.330
<b>Okay</b>

00:07:41.460 --> 00:07:44.460
Since you came to have fun and hang out,
we'll just do that instead!

00:07:44.630 --> 00:07:48.250
Come on, come on!
I don't want to let your cute outfit go to waste!

00:07:49.540 --> 00:07:51.460
It's actually not a cute outfit.

00:07:51.460 --> 00:07:53.580
I'm only wearing the casual clothes that I usually do!

00:07:53.580 --> 00:07:55.250
I didn't know your magic wand could do that!

00:07:55.750 --> 00:08:00.420
Heartful, heartful, peach, woo!

00:07:56.170 --> 00:07:58.170
The Heartful Peach Morphing Stick!

00:07:58.170 --> 00:07:59.630
It's such a cool name!

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:04.250
<b>VERY FANCY</b>

00:08:01.000 --> 00:08:03.830
This looks like it may be
a fun shop to check out. Let's go inside!

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:04.250
Sure.

00:08:06.080 --> 00:08:09.210
You know, we should adventure around the city
like this more often.

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:12.080
It might lead us to some unexpected clues.

00:08:12.790 --> 00:08:13.920
So, uh, anyways...

00:08:14.380 --> 00:08:16.170
We can't go shopping without buying something.

00:08:14.540 --> 00:08:14.830
<b>BEEP</b>

00:08:16.460 --> 00:08:18.420
So, to seal the deal and show you how sorry I am...

00:08:19.500 --> 00:08:21.000
I'll give you these!

00:08:23.330 --> 00:08:25.420
Heh, heh, heh. Take that, Momo Chiyoda!

00:08:25.420 --> 00:08:28.130
They may only be hair clips, but now I've corrupted
your pure look with some darkness!

00:08:28.420 --> 00:08:29.960
Heh, heh, heh.

00:08:33.290 --> 00:08:36.630
Hey Momo! Please let me challenge you
to the occasional duel, okay?

00:08:37.500 --> 00:08:41.790
I know that letter I wrote was hard to understand,
but the feelings behind it were genuine!

00:08:42.210 --> 00:08:42.830
Sure.

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:44.040
Bye for now!

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:45.580
Sure. Catch you later.

00:08:50.460 --> 00:08:53.670
I used all my money, but it was worth it for the fun I had!

00:08:54.080 --> 00:08:56.630
Maybe I can do some part-time work
during summer vacation.

